Subject: [PATCH 32/82] =?UTF-8?q?G7:=20inceleme=20d=C3=BCzeltmeleri=20(kap?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ak=20inince=20yaln=C4=B1zca=20kart=20band=C4=B1=20yenilenir)?=
